# Security

- Authentication ≠ authorization; every protected route must authorize
- Portal data: filter by `organizationId` — Customer A never sees Customer B
- Admin: RBAC permissions on every sensitive operation
- Prefer secure HTTP-only cookies for sessions; protect auth endpoints; rate-limit
- Validate all inputs; verify webhook signatures
- Never log passwords, tokens, or API secrets; never hard-code credentials
- Never expose backend secrets to React
- File uploads via `StorageProvider` with size/MIME limits
- Sensitive admin and high-risk AI actions → `AuditLog`
- Details: `docs/SECURITY.md`
